        "original_id": "03ad0e2b-ebf7-589c-88d7-316c41dcb8a6",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: DFB Sports Court, German Football Association\n- Concepts: sanctions, state associations, clubs, members\n\nFacts:\n- The DFB Sports Court is a regulatory body within the German Football Association.\n- The DFB Sports Court may impose different sanctions on clubs and players.\n- The German Football Association has 21 state associations.\n- The 21 state associations of the German Football Association include more than 25,000 clubs with more than 6.8 million members.\n- The German Football Association is the single largest sports federation in the world.",
